WEBVTT

00:00:03.623 --> 00:00:05.958
(birds chirping)

00:00:08.561 --> 00:00:10.530
(yawns)
Can we go back now?

00:00:10.563 --> 00:00:13.699
Already?
Just a couple more hours.

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:15.701
We have to be home
before it gets dark.

00:00:15.735 --> 00:00:18.538
(sighs)
I don't understand.

00:00:18.571 --> 00:00:21.441
I did exactly what
the man said.

00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:23.109
You mean that one-eyed,
scar-faced man

00:00:23.143 --> 00:00:24.810
that everybody laughed at?

00:00:24.844 --> 00:00:26.746
Yeah. It makes no sense.

00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:28.481
Look, Agnes, maybe we're not...

00:00:28.514 --> 00:00:30.183
-(branch snaps)
-(gasps)

00:00:33.253 --> 00:00:35.655
(rustling)

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.963
Ooh! My whole life has been
building to this moment.

00:00:46.532 --> 00:00:49.502
(bleats)

00:00:49.535 --> 00:00:50.503
(gasps)

00:00:50.536 --> 00:00:51.504
Um, it's a...

00:00:51.537 --> 00:00:53.973
Unicorn!
(giggling)

00:00:54.006 --> 00:00:57.009
-(bleating)
-I can't believe it!

00:00:57.042 --> 00:00:59.945
(gasps)
I'm gonna name you Lucky!

00:00:59.979 --> 00:01:04.684
(laughing):
Oh, Lucky, stop it!

00:01:04.717 --> 00:01:07.820
Yeah, I'll let someone else
burst her bubble.

00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:10.190
*

00:01:13.626 --> 00:01:15.761
DRU:
Look at us!

00:01:15.795 --> 00:01:17.763
Two brothers pulling a heist!

00:01:17.797 --> 00:01:20.333
And that diamond
will make us the richest,

00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:23.336
most powerful villains
in the world!

00:01:23.369 --> 00:01:24.804
Right, brother?

00:01:24.837 --> 00:01:26.806
Oh! Right.

00:01:26.839 --> 00:01:29.074
Yep. Yeah.

00:01:30.643 --> 00:01:33.613
Bravo! Bravissimo!

00:01:33.646 --> 00:01:35.615
You're amazing! I'm so sorry.

00:01:35.648 --> 00:01:37.283
I'm so embarrassed.
I was very rude.

00:01:37.317 --> 00:01:38.851
-And you were always such
a gentleman. -You did it!

00:01:38.884 --> 00:01:41.120
You did it!
You got our jobs back!

00:01:41.153 --> 00:01:43.489
*

00:01:47.026 --> 00:01:50.062
(stammers, clears throat)
What? Oh, yeah, right. Sure.

00:01:50.095 --> 00:01:52.432
Oh, look! We're here!

00:01:59.171 --> 00:02:00.740
I'm going in. Take the wheel.

00:02:00.773 --> 00:02:03.843
Aw, I still don't see
why I can't go with you.

00:02:03.876 --> 00:02:05.345
Hey, hey! We discussed this.

00:02:05.378 --> 00:02:07.847
Now is not the time
to mess with the plan!

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.315
Fine.

00:02:09.349 --> 00:02:10.916
-(beep)
-(grunts)

00:02:16.956 --> 00:02:18.258
(beeping)

00:02:21.026 --> 00:02:22.395
(laughs)

00:02:22.428 --> 00:02:24.397
Hey, brother!

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:27.400
What? I told you, you are
supposed to stay with the boat!

00:02:27.433 --> 00:02:30.736
Oh, I didn't think
you meant that literally.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:32.738
What other way
could I have meant it?!

00:02:32.772 --> 00:02:34.574
(sighs)
All right. Let's move.

00:02:34.607 --> 00:02:36.442
Just follow my lead.

00:02:36.476 --> 00:02:37.710
(groans)
Got it.

00:02:37.743 --> 00:02:40.346
(grunts, shouting)

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.515
(shouting)
Help me!

00:02:42.548 --> 00:02:44.717
Ow, ow, ow! Oh, no!

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.452
The poison spikes!
(whimpers)

00:02:46.486 --> 00:02:47.853
I'm gonna be impaled!

00:02:47.887 --> 00:02:50.089
(shouts)

00:02:50.122 --> 00:02:52.525
(chuckles)
I'm okay!

00:02:52.558 --> 00:02:55.027
(sighs)
I miss the Minions.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:57.263
Come on!

00:02:57.297 --> 00:02:59.632
(whimpering)

00:03:01.734 --> 00:03:03.436
Coming!

00:03:03.469 --> 00:03:05.371
(grunting)

00:03:05.405 --> 00:03:07.607
(strained grunting)

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.208
(panting)

00:03:09.241 --> 00:03:10.910
Coming!

00:03:10.943 --> 00:03:13.279
(grunting)

00:03:15.515 --> 00:03:16.482
Come on.

00:03:16.516 --> 00:03:17.917
(clicking, whirring)

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.151
(screams)

00:03:19.184 --> 00:03:20.720
(whimpering)

00:03:20.753 --> 00:03:22.655
(beeping)

00:03:22.688 --> 00:03:24.390
It's a scanning device!

00:03:24.424 --> 00:03:26.058
Quick, camouflage mode.

00:03:26.091 --> 00:03:29.395
Freeze! And close your eyes!

00:03:29.429 --> 00:03:31.931
-And cover your mouth!
-(inhales, squeaks)

00:03:31.964 --> 00:03:34.967
(beeping)

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.402
(whimpers)

00:03:36.436 --> 00:03:38.070
Okay, take my hand!

00:03:38.103 --> 00:03:39.472
(grunting)

00:03:39.505 --> 00:03:41.807
(Dru shouting, grunting)

00:03:46.779 --> 00:03:49.482
(muffled shouting)

00:03:49.515 --> 00:03:51.817
(grunting)

00:03:57.857 --> 00:03:59.859
(groans)

00:03:59.892 --> 00:04:02.294
-(beep)
-(chuckles)

00:04:02.328 --> 00:04:03.963
Follow me.

00:04:03.996 --> 00:04:06.198
(gasps, chuckles)

00:04:06.231 --> 00:04:08.634
(shouts, grunts)

00:04:08.668 --> 00:04:11.871
(shouting, grunting)

00:04:11.904 --> 00:04:13.873
(shouting)

00:04:13.906 --> 00:04:17.242
(deflating, sputtering)

00:04:20.913 --> 00:04:22.882
(chuckles)

00:04:22.915 --> 00:04:25.250
(Dru screaming)

00:04:27.487 --> 00:04:29.455
-Look out!
-(shouts)

00:04:29.489 --> 00:04:30.289
(Dru shouts)

00:04:30.322 --> 00:04:32.492
(grunting)

00:04:32.525 --> 00:04:34.226
Well, you were right.

00:04:34.259 --> 00:04:36.161
I should have stayed
in the boat.

00:04:36.195 --> 00:04:39.231
My stomach feels all queasy.

00:04:39.264 --> 00:04:42.334
I shouldn't have eaten
that pot pie.

00:04:42.368 --> 00:04:43.803
(groans)

00:04:43.836 --> 00:04:45.971
Hey, hey, relax.

00:04:46.005 --> 00:04:47.873
You're gonna be just fine.

00:04:47.907 --> 00:04:49.675
I got your back.

00:04:53.012 --> 00:04:56.048
(beeping)

00:04:56.081 --> 00:04:57.917
Come on. This way.

00:05:00.185 --> 00:05:01.887
(speaking Minionese)

00:05:01.921 --> 00:05:03.556
Go, go, go!

00:05:03.589 --> 00:05:07.593
-(speaking Minionese)
-Huh? Ah, okay, okay.

00:05:07.627 --> 00:05:09.429
* One more time, tell me

00:05:09.462 --> 00:05:12.364
* We been down together
for so long *

00:05:12.398 --> 00:05:13.833
(groans)

00:05:13.866 --> 00:05:15.835
-* Solid as stone
-(grunting)

00:05:15.868 --> 00:05:19.672
-* The lights went out
-(groaning)

00:05:19.705 --> 00:05:21.240
* Can't tell you what to do

00:05:21.273 --> 00:05:23.443
-* It's not allowed
-(shouting)

00:05:23.476 --> 00:05:26.111
-* You don't like crowds
-* Don't like crowds *

00:05:26.145 --> 00:05:27.780
* But you got to get out

00:05:27.813 --> 00:05:29.949
Go, go, go, go, go!

00:05:29.982 --> 00:05:32.618
* You could change the world
if you change your route *

00:05:32.652 --> 00:05:35.455
-* Change your route *
-* Got to leave your house

00:05:35.488 --> 00:05:37.723
-* Leave the house *
-* Go inside out

00:05:37.757 --> 00:05:39.925
-Hmm? -* I know
you're probably saying, G *

00:05:39.959 --> 00:05:41.927
-* I know you're probably
saying, G * - I know *

00:05:41.961 --> 00:05:43.729
-* You're excited but whoa,
whoa, whoa * -Huh? Hey!

00:05:43.763 --> 00:05:45.631
-(shouts) -* 'Cause
you really didn't believe *

00:05:45.665 --> 00:05:47.933
-* Believe * - You didn't
think that we would go *

00:05:47.967 --> 00:05:49.602
-* Go, go
-(speaking Minionese)

00:05:49.635 --> 00:05:52.271
* Well, you know what they say
about the show *

00:05:52.304 --> 00:05:55.140
* Even if you don't play,
it must go on *

00:05:55.174 --> 00:05:57.610
Hello. Hello. Hello.

00:05:57.643 --> 00:06:01.146
* But don't take it no way, me
and my brothers got to do it *

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:04.617
-* Do it, do it, do it, do it,
do it, do it * -(chiming)

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:07.820
(speaking Minionese)

00:06:07.853 --> 00:06:09.589
-(grunts, speaking muffledly)
-* One more time

00:06:09.622 --> 00:06:11.323
* Tell me, just got to do it

00:06:11.356 --> 00:06:12.758
-* Do it, do it
-(laughing)

00:06:12.792 --> 00:06:14.960
* Do it, do it, do it, do it

00:06:14.994 --> 00:06:17.229
* Hey-a!

00:06:17.262 --> 00:06:18.831
(speaking Minionese)

00:06:18.864 --> 00:06:21.266
* One more time, tell me,
just got to do it *

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:25.004
* Do it, do it, do it,
do it, do it, do it *

00:06:25.037 --> 00:06:26.438
* Hey-a!

00:06:26.472 --> 00:06:29.008
(shouting)

00:06:29.041 --> 00:06:31.176
GRU (quietly):
Looks like it's right above us.

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.946
DRU: Okay, what do I do?
Should I wait in the vent?

00:06:33.979 --> 00:06:35.648
GRU:
No, come with me.

00:06:38.217 --> 00:06:40.786
(grunting)

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:44.456
(grunts, exhales)

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:45.858
(sighs)

00:06:45.891 --> 00:06:47.326
(beeping)

00:06:47.359 --> 00:06:48.460
(gasps)

00:06:48.494 --> 00:06:50.863
-Dru, get off the bed.
-(gasps)

00:06:50.896 --> 00:06:53.032
Yes, I'd like
to thank the Academy.

00:06:53.065 --> 00:06:55.535
(snoring)

00:06:55.568 --> 00:06:57.803
-I can help. What? -No,
no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:06:57.837 --> 00:06:59.539
-I can do it. -Don't,
don't, don't. -Why, yes.

00:06:59.572 --> 00:07:01.006
Yes, Molly Ringwald,

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.008
-I will take you to the prom.
-(beeping)

00:07:03.042 --> 00:07:04.810
-What? Who? Where? What?
Who's there? -GRU: Go, go.

00:07:04.844 --> 00:07:06.311
-Who is there?!
-(Dru whimpering)

00:07:06.345 --> 00:07:08.047
-("99 Luftballons" playing)
-(alarm beeping)

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.550
(song playing, alarm beeping)

00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:11.416
(song and beeping stop)

00:07:13.018 --> 00:07:16.689
BALTHAZAR:
* 99 of red balloons...

00:07:16.722 --> 00:07:18.824
-Whoops! Almost forgot!
-(inhales)

00:07:22.928 --> 00:07:24.597
(exhales)

00:07:29.101 --> 00:07:31.203
Shh. Shh. Over here.

00:07:33.072 --> 00:07:34.674
Stay close.

00:07:35.775 --> 00:07:37.076
(gasps)

00:07:37.109 --> 00:07:38.644
Wha?

00:07:38.678 --> 00:07:40.079
Dolls.

00:07:40.112 --> 00:07:42.682
Looks like Bratt
was the only one stupid enough

00:07:42.715 --> 00:07:44.183
to buy this junk.

00:07:44.216 --> 00:07:47.419
Oh, I used to have
one of these!

00:07:47.452 --> 00:07:49.254
(mimicking laser blasts)

00:07:49.288 --> 00:07:51.423
(yelping)

00:07:51.456 --> 00:07:53.525
-(whimpers)
-Hey, shh!

00:07:53.559 --> 00:07:55.728
Come on.

